#: includes/class-p2s-scanner.php:498
msgid "Some plugins could not be verified"
msgstr "Деякі плагіни не вдалося перевірити"

#: includes/class-p2s-scanner.php:498
msgid ""
"The checksum request failed (network or wordpress.org unavailable). Try "
